 "text": "Howard County Treasurer - Howard County Business & Tourism -->\nHoward County Treasurer - Howard County Business & Tourism\nYou are using an outdated browser. Please upgrade your browser .\nMENU MENU\nCommunities\nCity of Chester\nCity of Cresco\nCity of Elma\nCity of Lime Springs\nCity of Protivin\nCity of Riceville\nBusinesses\nWhy Howard County?\nBusiness Directory\nEconomic Development\nStarting A Business\nBusiness Resources\nTourism\nUpcoming Events\nThings to Do\nPlaces to Stay\nCommunity Festivals\nTourism Resources\nAbout Howard County\nDepartments\nMoving Here\nInteresting People & Places\nResidents\nEmployment\nRental Properties & More\nVeterans\nCOVID-19 Info\nFarmers Markets\nResident Resources\nContact Us\nHoward County Treasurer\n-->\nBusinesses\nHoward County Treasurer\nHome Businesses Howard County Treasurer\nAddress\n137 North Elm Street, Cresco, IA 52136, USA\nContact\nChristine Hron\nPhone\n563.547.9211\nFax\n563.547.9217\nEmail\nConnect with tHem\nOpen Howard County Treasurer’s Facebook\nOpen Howard County Treasurer’s Twitter\nVisit Website\nCounty Treasurer: Christine Hron\nDeputy Treasurer: Norma Albertson\nDeputy Motor Vehicle: Delores Praska\nDriver License Deputy: Michelle Donlan\nPart-time Clerk: Dawn Gossman\nThe Treasurer’s office is responsible for all transactions with motor vehicle registration and collection of Use Tax, preparing and mailing annual tax statements, property tax collections, and tax apportionment to all taxing bodies. The County Treasurer is also responsible for investment of county funds, balancing financial records, issuing drivers licenses, CDL testing, and issuing CDL licenses.\nHours\nMonday – Friday 8:00am – 4:30pm\nAuto & motorcycle testing and license issuing every day by appointment M – F 8:00am – 4:15pm\nCategories: Cresco Departments\n+ −\nLeaflet | © OpenStreetMap contributors\nHoward County Business & Tourism\n101 2nd Ave SW\nCresco, Iowa 52136\n(563) 547 - 3434\nContact Us\nCopyright © 2026 - Howard County Business & Tourism. | All Rights Reserved.\nPowered by Iroc Web Design Services .\nTop",
